# Android Studio download packs

When packaging Android for Android Studio / Play AAB (zip download, handoff, “give me the file”):

## Binding rules

- **Never** zip only `frontend/android`. Capacitor plugins resolve via `../node_modules/...` in `capacitor.settings.gradle`. An android-only zip causes `No matching variant of project :capacitor-*` / `No variants exist`.
- Always pack **`frontend/android` + the Capacitor plugin `node_modules`** as siblings under `frontend/`.
- Tell the user to open **`frontend/android`** inside the unzipped pack (not a lone `android` folder).
- Prefer the script: `frontend/scripts/pack-android-studio.sh` (bumps nothing; syncs if needed; publishes under a new filename to avoid CDN cache).
- Signing: key alias `luminexa`; passwords live only in `_keystore-backup-DO-NOT-COMMIT/` — do not commit them.

## Required node_modules (match `capacitor.settings.gradle`)

- `@capacitor/android`, `app`, `filesystem`, `geolocation`, `push-notifications`, `share`, `splash-screen`, `status-bar`
- `@capawesome/capacitor-android-edge-to-edge-support`
- `capacitor-native-settings`

Exclude `.gradle`, `**/build`, `local.properties`, `.idea` from the zip.
